{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42905","headline":"赠进士李守微 · 韩屿","name":"赠进士李守微","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一定童颜老岁华，贫寒游历贵人家。\n炼成正气功应大，养得元神道不差。\n舃曳鹤毛乾毾𣬬，杖携筇节瘦槎牙\n如何蓬阆不归去，落尽蟠桃几度花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩屿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}